---
/**
 * Hero section: large headline + subheadline.
 */
---

<section class="hero">
  <h1 class="hero__headline text-taupe-950 pb-4">
    Jake Culp <span class="text-taupe-600">is a</span> <br />
    product designer <span class="text-taupe-600">based</span><br />
    <span text-taupe-600>in</span> <span class="text-green-700">Philadelphia</span>, Pennsylvania.
  </h1>
  <p class="hero__subheadline text-taupe-600">
    He enjoys working on new, innovative ideas, crafting design systems, brazilian jiu jitsu, and drinking smoothies.
  </p>
</section>

<style>
  .hero {
    padding-block: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 4rem) 0;
  }

  .hero__headline {
    font-family: "Fraunces Variable", sans-serif;
    font-weight: 300;
    font-variation-settings: "WONK" 0, "SOFT" 100;
    font-optical-sizing: auto;
    font-size: clamp(32px, 5.053px + 8.421vw, 64px);
    line-height: 1.10;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }

  .hero__subheadline {
    font-family: "Geist", sans-serif;
    font-size: clamp(1.25rem, 2vw, 1.5rem);
    line-height: 1.3;
  }
</style>
